{"id":"1faebf4a40799c0213664b0185f1fcb03293671c","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251945","title":"你们怎么看待 \"同样都是调 AI，凭什么说你比我强?\" / \"不就是调 AI 吗?\" 这两句话？已经在好几个圈子看过类似的言论了。","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"qwertyiuop","excerpt":"职场话题 - @qwertyiuop -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"r_18222153\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3590/0a98/173969_normal.png?m=1747363963\" alt=\"coderluan\" data-uid=\"173969\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coderluan\">coderluan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 16:32:50 +08:00\">19h 6m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>AI 是过程不是结果，强调过程而不是结果就是打嘴仗，和\"哥哥都那么努力了\"没啥区别。</p><p>谁能证明谁的成品效果好，那谁才是真的强，AI is cheap(not so cheap)，show me the App.</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div></DIV>","content_text":"6 coderluan 19h 6m ago 1 AI 是过程不是结果，强调过程而不是结果就是打嘴仗，和\"哥哥都那么努力了\"没啥区别。谁能证明谁的成品效果好，那谁才是真的强，AI is cheap(not so cheap)，show me the App.","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T03:43:56.466Z","ok":true}